# Story 4: why Harlow lost his licence
picture chief_office_harlowe_return2.jpg

Chief: He was trusted to fly the general's birthday party in: the officers' wives, an all-female quintet and a crate of fine malt whiskey.

Chief: He ditched in the sea by a deserted island. The rescue party took fourteen hours.

Chief: Harlow was found passed out in the shrubbery wearing only his underpants... the trombonist was unable to perform for a month!

Chief: He woke up without a licence, heading the Federal Monkey Patrol.
